note v1.4 interop demo: build a React component and scaffold a Vite app.
note Usage: python3 jesun.py examples/react_demo.jc
note Writes ./demo-app/ (package.json, index.html, src/main.jsx, src/App.jsx).

bring in "react"

card is component with "Card" and ["title", "body"] and "<article className=\"card\"><h2>{{title}}</h2><p>{{body}}</p></article>"
show card
show ""

paths is scaffold_app with "demo-app"
show "Wrote:"
for each p in paths
    show "  " + p
